• Player 1 (Cobalt): WASD / Arrows / Mouse or Gamepad 1
• Player 2 (Aggressor): IJKL / NumPad or Gamepad 2
• Layout Toggle: Press [F2] in-game to switch Horizontal (Top/Bottom) vs Vertical (Left/Right) split on the fly
• Combat: Mutual radar acquisition, machine gun bursts, and guided missile lock-ons"
